    "Its wallets, envelopes, transactions and recurring templates go with it. It disappears from every device of every member as they sync; the server keeps its history only to bring the deletion to them. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its wallets, envelopes, transactions and recurring templates go with it. It disappears from every device of every member as they sync; the server keeps its history only to bring the deletion to them. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Con lui se ne vanno i wallet, le buste, le transazioni e le ricorrenze che contiene. Sparisce da ogni dispositivo di ogni membro man mano che si sincronizzano; il server ne conserva la cronologia solo per portare loro la cancellazione. Non si può annullare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
